 src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2472940/extras/083a27ed518de7893fbfcee325aa5b35.webp?t=1761237725\" width=1170 height=30 /></span> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2472940/extras/03b0c708ef6ad2a875855cf65a50f72e.avif?t=1761237725\" width=1170 height=245 /></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Full next-gen remake</strong> of the award-winning VR time-travel adventure.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Physics-driven platforming</strong>: swim, jump, crouch, climb, zipline, and swing.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Visual makeover</strong>: fully overhauled, richer, more beautiful environments.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>World-class full-body avatars</strong> with <strong>mirror systems</strong> for unmatched presence.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Advanced haptics</strong>: proximity &amp; context-sensitive feedback for deeper immersion.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Samuel overhaul</strong>: new UI, storage system, time-travel upgrade, plus the <strong>Echo Diviner and Echo Vaults</strong> to locate lost items.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>New content</strong>: <strong>three brand-new levels</strong> set across richly detailed eras alongside much larger and extended levels.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Revamped combat</strong>: new combat system with fresh weapons, ammo types, and enemy behaviors.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Broader interactions</strong>: explore diverse historical moments with action, puzzles, and creative problem-solving.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2472940/extras/083a27ed518de7893fbfcee325aa5b35.webp?t=1761237725\" width=1170 height=30 /></span></p>", "short_description": "Step into the unknown and embark on an epic, time travel adventure, completely re-imagined. Introducing Wanderer: The Fragments of Fate, a remake of the critically acclaimed VR adventure game - Wanderer. There’s no telling where you’ll go and who you’ll become as you unravel the mysteries of time.", "supported_languages": "English<strong>*</strong>, French, Italian, German, Spanish - Spain, Simplified Chinese, Japanese, Korean<br><strong>*</strong>languages with full audio support", "reviews": "“The gameplay of The Fragments of Fates stands out in the action-adventure puzzle genre, particularly due to its emphasis on storytelling and narrative. However, what truly sets this game apart is its unique approach to puzzle-solving.”<br>94 – The VR Realm<br>", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2472940/58e2ac05fbcf561556d3a2fbcb2b4891ca09ba03/header.jpg?t=1761237725", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2472940/e28ec77fb5b45a34a7a5bc32a0548805f6193d69/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1761237725", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2472940/e28ec77fb5b45a34a7a5bc32a0548805f6193d69/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1761237725", "website": "https://www.wanderervr.com/", "pc_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires a 64-bit processor and operating system<br></li><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10 - 64 Bit<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel Core i7-9700K/AMD Ryzen 7 2700X or equivalent<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 16 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> Nvidia RTX 2070 8GB or equivalent<br></li><li><strong>DirectX:</strong> Version 12<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 50 GB available space<br></li><li><strong>VR Support:</strong> SteamVR or Oculus PC (Vive wands not currenty supported)<br></li><li><strong>Additional Notes:</strong> SSD required. A high-speed M.2 SSD dramatically reduces load times. Higher resolutions and refresh rates can impact performance - especially when using Meta Quest over the Link cable. GPUs with under 10 GB VRAM may struggle in heavy scenes due to Link’s VRAM overhead. For better performance, lower graphics to High or Medium and launch in Oculus VR mode from the Steam options.</li></ul>", "recommended": "<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires a 64-bit processor and operating system<br></li><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10 - 64 Bit<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel Core i9-11900K/AMD Ryzen 7 5800X or higher<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 16 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> Nvidia 3080 12GB or equivalent<br></li><li><strong>DirectX:</strong> Version 12<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 50 GB available space</li></ul>"}, "mac_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>", "recommended": "<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"}, "linux_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>", "recommended": "<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"}, "legal_notice": "©2025 Wanderer™. Developed by Mighty Eyes. All rights reserved.", "developers": ["Mighty Eyes"], "publishers": ["Mighty Eyes"], "demos": [{"appid": 3800660, "description": ""}], "price_overview": {"currency": "USD", "initial": 4999, "final": 4999, "discount_percent": 0, "initial_formatted": "", "final_formatted": "$49.99"}, "packages": [890018], "package_groups": [{"name": "default", "title": "Buy Wanderer: The Fragments of Fate", "description": "", "selection_text": "Select a purchase option", "save_text": "", "display_type": 0, "is_recurring_subscription": "false", "subs": [{"packageid": 890018, "percent_savings_text": " ", "percent_savings":